1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
No Rule Partnership has just started and
it's been almost a year.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:10,000
We collaborated with various companies
and organizations throughout Japan.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:14,000
This project started with the feeling of
gratitude for the 15th anniversary.

4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:21,000
We felt that we were being asked to be
idols to make Japan happy.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:28,992
So, in 2024, we will evolve this No Rule
Partnership into the next step.

6
00:00:28,992 --> 00:00:34,692
Not only us, but also the female idol
section of Stardust Promotion,

7
00:00:34,692 --> 00:00:37,992
and the members of Stardust Planet.

8
00:00:37,992 --> 00:00:43,992
We are the members of Stardust
Promotion, the company with 69
employees.

9
00:00:49,882 --> 00:00:52,882
Thank you for your cooperation.

10
00:00:54,882 --> 00:00:56,882
Mugen company, STAPRA.

11
00:00:56,882 --> 00:00:58,882
As the name suggests,

12
00:00:58,882 --> 00:01:11,882
we aim to create an infinite possibility
with a non-rule collaboration with 69
idols from all over Japan and STARDUST
PLANET.

13
00:01:11,882 --> 00:01:19,882
69 STAPRA members will use their
individuality and entertainment power as
employees.

14
00:01:20,032 --> 00:01:28,372
We will solve the problems of companies,
organizations and stores and cheer up
the Japanese people.

15
00:01:28,372 --> 00:01:34,612
So, Mugen Company STAPRA will start
today.

16
00:01:34,612 --> 00:01:41,952
Today, April 1st, many companies are
holding the inauguration ceremony
nationwide.

17
00:01:41,952 --> 00:01:49,332
In a sense, Mugen Company STAPRA also
celebrated the inauguration ceremony
today.

18
00:01:49,488 --> 00:01:57,488
Speaking of the company, who is the
president?

19
00:01:57,488 --> 00:02:01,488
Who is the president?

20
00:02:01,488 --> 00:02:04,488
President...

21
00:02:04,488 --> 00:02:07,488
But the oldest is...

22
00:02:07,488 --> 00:02:09,488
Emi-chan?

23
00:02:09,488 --> 00:02:11,488
It was a surprise.

24
00:02:11,488 --> 00:02:13,488
Because she is the oldest.

25
00:02:13,488 --> 00:02:17,488
If you say the age, I will be the
oldest.

26
00:02:17,488 --> 00:02:19,216
But...

27
00:02:19,216 --> 00:02:22,032
At the end of the day, I'm the best

28
00:02:22,032 --> 00:02:24,032
I think so too

29
00:02:24,032 --> 00:02:26,032
I think I can do it well too

30
00:02:26,032 --> 00:02:28,032
Everyone can do it

31
00:02:28,032 --> 00:02:30,032
But I'm the same age as A-rin

32
00:02:30,032 --> 00:02:32,032
So your age doesn't matter

33
00:02:32,032 --> 00:02:34,032
But I really respect A-rin

34
00:02:34,032 --> 00:02:36,032
I think I'll go from Nagoya

35
00:02:36,032 --> 00:02:38,032
But I want to do it too

36
00:02:38,032 --> 00:02:40,032
There are many people who want to do it

37
00:02:40,032 --> 00:02:42,032
There are many people who want to do it

38
00:02:42,032 --> 00:02:44,032
Right?

39
00:02:44,032 --> 00:02:46,032
I want to be the president

40
00:02:46,032 --> 00:02:48,032
I want to be the president

41
00:02:48,032 --> 00:02:50,032
I really admire the president

42
00:02:50,032 --> 00:02:52,032
President is the best

43
00:02:52,032 --> 00:02:54,032
Can you raise your hand a little bit
earlier?

44
00:02:54,032 --> 00:02:56,032
Sorry

45
00:02:56,032 --> 00:02:58,032
Everyone raised their hands

46
00:03:00,032 --> 00:03:02,032
Then I will

47
00:03:02,032 --> 00:03:04,032
No, no, no

48
00:03:04,032 --> 00:03:06,032
What's different?

49
00:03:06,032 --> 00:03:08,032
What's different?

50
00:03:08,032 --> 00:03:10,032
What's different?

51
00:03:10,032 --> 00:03:12,032
Please forgive me

52
00:03:14,032 --> 00:03:16,032
Leader, not president

53
00:03:16,032 --> 00:03:18,032
Then who will ask for it?

54
00:03:18,032 --> 00:03:20,032
What?

55
00:03:20,032 --> 00:03:22,032
I'm the only one

56
00:03:22,032 --> 00:03:24,032
I'm going back

57
00:03:24,032 --> 00:03:26,032
Then, well,

58
00:03:26,032 --> 00:03:28,032
It's a very good company with a good
wind

59
00:03:28,032 --> 00:03:30,032
I see

60
00:03:30,032 --> 00:03:32,032
Let's be friends

61
00:03:32,032 --> 00:03:34,032
Let's do our best together

62
00:03:34,032 --> 00:03:36,032
Yes

63
00:03:36,032 --> 00:03:38,032
Thank you

64
00:03:38,032 --> 00:03:39,881
Thank you
